    "detailed_description": "\u300aNavigator\u300bis a casual puzzle game of &quot;space&quot; and &quot;galaxies&quot;. Find the right paths to release all sealed stars and collect lost constellation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the Paths,Release the stars</h2>In each level, you got one chance to launch the ball, which slow down over time. You need to pass all dusty boxes before it stops.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/2090a2a08b21c5da21e3f07038323641.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/2090a2a08b21c5da21e3f07038323641.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/2090a2a08b21c5da21e3f07038323641.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigator</h2>Navigators provides the ball with extra momentum as well as change it's direction.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/265ed28e503ca7233e57b76427424aa8.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/265ed28e503ca7233e57b76427424aa8.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/265ed28e503ca7233e57b76427424aa8.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Variety of Mechanics and Challenges</h2>Each chapter introduces a new, unique mechanic, which changes the level significantly. Try to understand and use these mechanics to overcome the challenges !<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/c436eb34c49663e58dc084c8ad42e4f4.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/c436eb34c49663e58dc084c8ad42e4f4.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/c436eb34c49663e58dc084c8ad42e4f4.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/f4200ddbd0af473e58c4ca924e2ce97f.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/f4200ddbd0af473e58c4ca924e2ce97f.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/f4200ddbd0af473e58c4ca924e2ce97f.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witness the Reappearence of Constellations</h2>The stars in each level form an unique constellation, which will appear when all stars are unsealed. Try to collect all constellations !<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/69f92fc01c24de503be683d34933d6b6.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/69f92fc01c24de503be683d34933d6b6.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/69f92fc01c24de503be683d34933d6b6.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are 10 chapters with unique mechanics. Demo will contain 4 chapters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are over 150 levels. Demo will contain 65 levels.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "\u300aNavigator\u300bis a casual puzzle game of &quot;space&quot; and &quot;galaxies&quot;. Find the right paths to release all sealed stars and collect lost constellation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the Paths,Release the stars</h2>In each level, you got one chance to launch the ball, which slow down over time. You need to pass all dusty boxes before it stops.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/2090a2a08b21c5da21e3f07038323641.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/2090a2a08b21c5da21e3f07038323641.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/2090a2a08b21c5da21e3f07038323641.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigator</h2>Navigators provides the ball with extra momentum as well as change it's direction.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/265ed28e503ca7233e57b76427424aa8.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/265ed28e503ca7233e57b76427424aa8.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/265ed28e503ca7233e57b76427424aa8.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Variety of Mechanics and Challenges</h2>Each chapter introduces a new, unique mechanic, which changes the level significantly. Try to understand and use these mechanics to overcome the challenges !<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/c436eb34c49663e58dc084c8ad42e4f4.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/c436eb34c49663e58dc084c8ad42e4f4.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/c436eb34c49663e58dc084c8ad42e4f4.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/f4200ddbd0af473e58c4ca924e2ce97f.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/f4200ddbd0af473e58c4ca924e2ce97f.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/f4200ddbd0af473e58c4ca924e2ce97f.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witness the Reappearence of Constellations</h2>The stars in each level form an unique constellation, which will appear when all stars are unsealed. Try to collect all constellations !<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/69f92fc01c24de503be683d34933d6b6.poster.avif?t=1727326944\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/69f92fc01c24de503be683d34933d6b6.webm?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164290/extras/69f92fc01c24de503be683d34933d6b6.mp4?t=1727326944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are 10 chapters with unique mechanics. Demo will contain 4 chapters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are over 150 levels. Demo will contain 65 levels.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A casual puzzle game of &quot;Mysterious Galaxy&quot;. Plan the movement path and unseal the stars. Experience a variety of mechanisms and challenges in galaxies with different themes. Use your wisdom to overcome difficulties and witness the reappearance of ancient constellations!",
